<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese Ambassador Jing Quan said Beijing could easily win a conflict with the Philippines, prompting PCG spokesperson Jay Tarriela to label the remark a direct threat. President Marcos pledged to strengthen the Philippine Coast Guard and announced a 5‑day maritime defence drill along the eastern Mindanao seaboard, while the Philippines and United States conducted a bilateral maritime exercise with navy and coast guard vessels operating together. The Philippines also received modernization support from Japan for its coast guard. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPWFhfMHlEdmc2UmdNcVdLN1gzRjg2cGNiZ00tdklqc0xhNEJESmR2dUxjQ2tVQTJ0Rm5XLV9pc0NTMG1kdDYzNVZhQnFPSnV3YUdUdURhbE1Vd2IxcVhMN0hXd1dHc19XN1ctUmEwQTc1WEhlZ3hzNjFFMnRYb25ROUlxOE5zQU55aEVZenNLTjI5aTNSYlZBcEEzbURKR2V0RXg1dlRxMGtvVk41MEtuSjloZ2xXdGF1OXpoMXZ3Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPVmFGd1Y3ZjlXS3ZYQkVYcnNLOFg3a3hNNWdMekgwLUgyMzZWWGZmbzByQ0NzLTZPWHZ1R2xydWkxR0VNR2FVTXo4NG5ZYXRSYjY2YUpvbjF6R0FQQUNFSFBhekFFY2hxYnhDZ05pTFpGUF9aUklyOW9ReHFXWmtuX2RGZW1va2w0YkJqcGtYX3pxWVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNRDBpamtBUHpKZTN2WmRDOXIyN2YwVS0wb3o2NFZ3b1B4UUpFNnNJM3JaMFVsa09RZGl5ZUhHajJKcEkyd01XQnZFMWZEOTVteDhIMFY2c092b2pScmVWa3Q1T2VYUDVtYXFPem5fNnJ2aFJaZnRMRWJxR3BTYzNseTFiTzZRdndnWnVxQUtma1VvcHJKWGZaUGxIc2FGblF5eHhKbGRrc2ZzbDVhTmYxUklJN1FiQ0NKd1dXbHhLMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hre